WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.420
Luffy’s Devil Fruit Powers are pretty much
the single most important thing in all of

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:05.420
One Piece.

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:09.090
For the longest time we thought that Luffy
is someone so strong-willed and fearless,

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:14.059
that he somehow overcomes the seemingly weak
powers of his Rubber devil fruit again and

00:00:14.059 --> 00:00:18.771
again, for most of the story grinding his
way past enemies with way stronger devil fruit

00:00:18.771 --> 00:00:19.771
powers.

00:00:19.771 --> 00:00:23.869
That’s until his epic battle with Kaido,
where we find out that it has actually been

00:00:23.869 --> 00:00:26.090
the other way around all along.

00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:31.029
In reality Luffy has been the person with
possibly the strongest devil fruit in the

00:00:31.029 --> 00:00:34.850
story, that allows him to turn anything he
imagines into reality.

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:40.050
However, Shanks gave it a fake name and tricked
Luffy into using it in its weakest form for

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:41.230
almost the entire story.

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:45.149
Which in a way makes it even more impressive
that he has managed to come this far while

00:00:45.149 --> 00:00:48.649
holding back like 99% of his true power.

00:00:48.649 --> 00:00:52.649
But that leaves a really interesting question
on the table, that every real one piece fan

00:00:52.649 --> 00:00:59.609
has asked themselves before: What would have
happened if Luffy had eaten another extremely

00:00:59.609 --> 00:01:01.870
overpowered devil fruit as a kid?

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:06.729
Now, of course there are many ultra powerful
fruits in the story to choose from, like Enel’s

00:01:06.729 --> 00:01:11.009
lightning fruit, Kaido’s dragon fruit or
Whitebeard’s Earthquake fruit.

00:01:11.009 --> 00:01:14.670
And if you want to see me cover those fruits
in another video soon, make sure that you’re

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:15.760
subscribed to the channel.

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:21.100
But for today, to make things a bit easier,
I’ve decided on 5 devil fruits that I would

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:27.619
just love to see Luffy use in the actual story:
And these are the devil fruits of the 5 Marine

00:01:27.619 --> 00:01:34.159
Admirals: Aokiji’s Ice fruit, Kizaru’s
Light Fruit, Akainu’s Magma Fruit, Fujitora’s

00:01:34.159 --> 00:01:37.119
Gravity Fruit and Greenbull’s Forest fruit.

00:01:37.119 --> 00:01:42.530
If Luffy had eaten each of these 5 ridiculously
overpowered fruits, how would the course of

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:44.191
Luffy’s journey have changed significantly?

00:01:44.191 --> 00:01:48.610
And how would Luffy have used all these fruits
compared to the admirals?

00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:53.420
We begin in Luffy’s childhood, where Luffy
accidentally eats the devil fruit that Shanks

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:56.329
and his crew have just stolen from a marine
ship.

00:01:56.329 --> 00:02:03.310
And we know that Shanks got his hands on Luffy’s
furit on purpose, because it is important.

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:08.190
To give Luffy a different devil fruit, let’s
just assume that Shanks has not only one,

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:10.050
but two devil fruits with him.

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:15.090
And instead of the purple rubber fruit, hungry
kid Luffy eats the second one.

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:19.450
Now, as you might know, all the admiral’s
devil fruit powers share one similarity: They

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:26.150
belong to a category called Logia, which turn
their users entire body into a force of nature.

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:30.879
The only exception here is Fujitora’s Gravity
fruit, because we actually don’t know if

00:02:30.879 --> 00:02:36.630
it is Logia fruit like the others, or just
a regular ability, that has no effect on his

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:37.630
body.

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:41.831
For the sake of this video, we will go with
regular fruit, just to make things a bit more

00:02:41.831 --> 00:02:42.850
interesting.

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:47.730
So depending on each fruit, when Luffy eats
the devil fruit by accident and shanks grabs

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:51.920
him, instead of his arm stretching, Luffy’s
body reacts different.

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:54.540
For the ice fruit, he might freeze shanks’
arm.

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:58.150
For the light fruit, Shanks’ hand just passes
through Luffy.

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:01.810
For the magma fruit, Shanks burns himself
trying to touch luffy.

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:07.170
For the gravity fruit Shanks is suddenly smashed
into the ground and for the forest fruit luffy

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:11.830
just sprouts a little flower on his head and
his feet grow roots into the wooden floor

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:12.830
of the pub.

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:13.830
Now, the question if of course, what would
happen to Luffy’s original devil fruit in

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:14.830
this scenario?

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:18.720
Well, Shanks would give that fruit to Luffy’s
future brother Ace, the son of Gol D. Roger,

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:21.510
who also was Shanks’ captain.

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:25.560
In case you wonder why, I actually made a
whole video on what would happen if Luffy

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:30.370
was never born, where I explain in detail
why Shanks was originally looking for Ace

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:36.370
to give him this devil fruit and how Luffy
accidentally eating it, changed his and Roger’s

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:37.370
entire plan.

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:39.320
I recommend you check that out later.

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:44.939
But yeah, for our scenario here, Luffy has
now eaten a powerful logia fruit and Ace is

00:03:44.939 --> 00:03:47.260
the one to eat the Nika fruit.

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:51.750
Now one big question we need to ask ourselves
is of course: Would Shanks still sacrifice

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:57.349
his arm for Luffy and give him his straw hat,
if Luffy didn’t become the chosen one?

00:03:57.349 --> 00:04:01.590
I think there is a real argument to be made
here, that Shanks would rather try to inspire

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.220
Ace to become pirate king.

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:08.879
On the other hand, Shanks really took a liking
to Luffy even before he ate the devil fruit,

00:04:08.879 --> 00:04:14.100
and i think he would still come to save Luffy,
especially after he was willing to fight the

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:17.550
mountain bandits to defend the red hair pirates’
honour.

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:23.180
So yes, I think Shanks would still save Luffy
and inspire him to become a great pirate,

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:24.880
just because he likes Luffy.

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:29.790
However I think in this case, Shanks would
decide to keep his arm instead.

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:34.600
Ace would most likely not want his father’s
straw hat, because he blamed Roger for all

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:35.600
his suffering.

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:40.491
In case you didn’t know, Luffy’s hat used
to belong to Roger before he gave it to Shanks.

00:04:40.491 --> 00:04:47.600
And so I think it’s fair to assume that
Luffy would still end up getting the hat.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:51.580
After that, Luffy’s childhood stays pretty
much the same, only that he now learns to

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:56.780
use his logia fruit powers instead of rubber
powers, who now belong to his brother ace.

00:04:56.780 --> 00:05:00.979
So let’s get to the juicy bit and jump 10
years into the future, where Luffy leaves

00:05:00.979 --> 00:05:03.350
his home island to start his own crew.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:09.300
With 4 of the 5 fruits he would leave in his
small boat and end up in the barrel on Koby’s

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:10.300
ship.

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:13.720
If Luffy ate Aokiji’s ice fruit however,
I think he would be powerful enough after

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:19.100
10 years of training to freeze the ocean under
his feet and simply start walking across the

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:23.290
ocean, similar to how Aokiji uses his ability
to bike across the water.

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:28.300
In that case, he would probably still get
lost and somehow end up running into Kobe.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:34.030
Now, with Luffy having such overpowered abilities,
the journey through the east blue is even

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:35.560
easier than before.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:41.830
Luffy defeats Alvida, Morgan, Buggy, Kuro,
Don Krieg and Arlong with ease, who have absolutely

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:44.690
no chance against any of his 5 abilities.

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:49.970
Since we can assume that none of these enemies
has mastered any form of Haki, they wouldn’t

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:52.120
even be able to touch Luffy.

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:56.870
And even if it’s Luffy having the Gravity
powers, he would simply crush any of them

00:05:56.870 --> 00:06:00.970
under a pile of rubble before they could even
come close to him.

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:06.460
There is only one real obstacle for this version
of Luffy before entering the Grandline: And

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:07.460
that’s Smoker.

00:06:07.460 --> 00:06:12.099
In case you forgot, Smoker is Luffy’s marine
rival throughout the first half of the story

00:06:12.099 --> 00:06:15.280
and the first Logia fruit user we meet in
the story.

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:20.490
And since Luffy himself hasn’t mastered
Haki either, he can only win against another

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:26.180
Logia fruit user, if his element is the natural
weakness of his opponent’s element.

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:30.780
However, on top of that, Smoker also carries
a very unique weapon.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:36.080
The tip of it has been coated in a material
called sea prism stone, that nullifies any

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.180
devil fruit ability.

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:42.419
That means that even the invulnerable bodies
of a logia fruit user would become solid again.

00:06:42.419 --> 00:06:46.660
So, just like in the main story line, Luffy
would not be able to beat Smoker.

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:49.830
Wood has no effect on smoke whatsoever.

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:54.770
Ice and Magma can maybe create some sort of
wind to mess with Smoker a bit, but I don’t

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:58.770
think that it would be enough to stop or even
defeat him.

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:02.870
And since smoke is extremely light, Luffy
would need to have mastered his gravity powers

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:07.400
to an incredibly high level so that he could
affect Smoker here at all.

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:10.040
Which i think is unlikely.

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:14.610
Instead, Dragon once again has to step in
and save his son from the marine.

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:18.090
The only exception here, would be Kizaru’s
light fruit.

00:07:18.090 --> 00:07:23.030
Because it is so fast, that luffy would be
able to run away from Smoker and maybe even

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:24.740
blind him to get away.

00:07:24.740 --> 00:07:28.460
And as you’ll see, as we enter the first
half of the grandline, this will be a sort

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:33.910
of pattern until we finally start to face
characters who know Haki and until Luffy learns

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:35.270
Haki himself.

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:40.940
Enemies that seem to have no haki abilities,
such as Wapol or Moria have no chance against

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:43.250
Luffy, because they literally can’t touch
him.

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:47.810
Does Rob Lucci and the rest of CP9 have haki
before the timeskip?

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:52.490
On the one hand, it would be strange if they
did not, given that they are special agents,

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:57.530
but at the same time, there is no hint what
so ever, that any of them is using any form

00:07:57.530 --> 00:08:00.289
of Haki during their battle with the straw
hats on Enies Lobby.

00:08:00.289 --> 00:08:06.599
So I think that only gravity Luffy would have
any trouble with Lucci, although even then,

00:08:06.599 --> 00:08:12.550
Luffy would be powerful enough to take him
down and probably collapse all of Enies Lobby

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:13.940
with him.

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:18.770
The real challenges during this part of the
journey, until we come to the war at Marineford,

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:22.000
are of course the other Logia users in the
story.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:26.990
Starting with the one and only sir crocodile,
the main antagonist of the alabasta saga.

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:31.780
As you probably remember, Crocodile ate the
dryness or sand logia devil fruit.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:37.690
And Luffy was only able to beat him by coating
himself in water and his own blood, since

00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:41.159
humidity is dryness’ natural weakness.

00:08:41.159 --> 00:08:45.550
So how would Logia luffy without any Haki
do against Crocodile?

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:47.971
It really comes down to match-ups here.

00:08:47.971 --> 00:08:52.120
Luffy having AOkiji’s ice powers, should
absolutely be able to win.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:56.350
Ice is quite solid and you can’t simply
dry it out, like a puddle of water.

00:08:56.350 --> 00:09:01.600
At the same time, given the high temperatures
in the desert country of Alabasta, Luffy would

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:06.600
be slightly melting on the surface all the
time, imitating the same effect he used to

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:09.000
defeat crocodile in the actual Story.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:13.040
With Greenbull’s devil fruit on the other
hand, Luffy would have been defeated very

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:14.040
fast.

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:20.250
Luffy’s forest powers would be absolutely
useless in the desert and even worse against

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:25.030
crocodile, who would be able to dry up any
of Luffy’s attacks and luffy himself.

00:09:25.030 --> 00:09:30.440
Similarly, the light fruit would be pretty
ineffective against Crocodile, who mostly

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:34.680
likely also had Haki at this point in the
story.

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:39.180
In both those cases, Luffy would have had
to resort to the very same water trick as

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:40.680
in the main story.

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:45.800
If Luffy had Gravity powers, I do think he
would have a quite decent chance to hurt Crocodile,

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:50.010
simply by crushing him into the ground, sand
particles or not.

00:09:50.010 --> 00:09:56.360
And the almighty magma fruit would simply
melt Crocodile’s sand and overwhelm it.

00:09:56.360 --> 00:10:01.550
We know that, because Crocodile managed to
block one of Akainu’s attacks during Marineford,

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:08.709
but was trying to get away from the admiral
as fast as possible to avoid taking more damage.

00:10:08.709 --> 00:10:12.899
Enel on the other hand, would be a completely
different story.

00:10:12.899 --> 00:10:17.899
The lightning fruit is arguably one of the
5 strongest fruits in the entire story and

00:10:17.899 --> 00:10:22.470
one of the most powerful logia fruits.

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:27.620
Luffy was able to beat Enel because his rubber
features made him immune to electricity.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.460
But how would Luffy have done against Enel
with a different devil fruit?

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:36.210
The light fruit at first glance seems quite
similar to Enel’s powers and you might think

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:39.720
that light and electricity don’t really
affect each other much.

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:44.779
But then again, Light is just the byproduct
of high energy and heat, so you could think

00:10:44.779 --> 00:10:50.600
of light Luffy as a living light bulb, that
could absorb all of Enel’s lightning and

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:52.190
turn it into energy himself.

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:53.190
Gravity on the other hand has no effect on
the much stronger electrical force in the

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:54.190
universe.

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:55.190
In this case, Luffy would lose quite quickly
to Enel.

00:10:55.190 --> 00:10:56.540
Similarly, Forest Luffy would not be able
to touch Enel at all.

00:10:56.540 --> 00:11:01.470
In return, we have seen that Enel is more
than capable of destroying plants and trees

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:04.470
with his crazy lightning bolds.

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:08.650
So far Greenbull’s forest fruit seems to
be the worst option for Luffy.

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:14.139
As for Ice and Magma, these could arguably
go either way, depending how these powers

00:11:14.139 --> 00:11:15.980
actually work in one piece.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:21.460
For ice, if Enel’s powers are stronger than
Luffy’s, the heat from his electricity would

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:26.790
start melting luffy and the more water there
is on luffy’s body, the more electricity

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:30.260
it conducts, the quicker luffy is defeated
by it.

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:34.810
on the other hand, if luffy’s ice powers
are as crazy as Aokiji’s cold can actually

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:36.470
slow down electrons.

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:39.740
basically reducing Enel’s electricity powers.

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:44.649
Similarly, having Akainu’s magma powers,
luffy could turn the area around him into

00:11:44.649 --> 00:11:48.529
hard rocky ground, which doesn’t conduct
any electricity.

00:11:48.529 --> 00:11:55.440
However magma itself, since it’s a hot liquid,
actually conducts electricity extremely well.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:56.550
So who would win?

00:11:56.550 --> 00:12:02.779
I think it comes down to who is more experienced
with their fruit power.

00:12:02.779 --> 00:12:07.149
Similar to both Aokiji and Akainu would have
been able to overpower each other.

00:12:07.149 --> 00:12:12.050
Extreme cold can make Magma useless, while
extreme hot can melt ice.

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:15.350
A question of pure endurance and power.

00:12:15.350 --> 00:12:20.490
Of course there are also the encounters with
Aokiji and Kizaru on Sabaody.

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:25.780
Now we could do the physics here again, but
the truth is, clearly they would be way more

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:31.769
skilled with their logia fruits than Luffy
and on top of that also have extremely powerful

00:12:31.769 --> 00:12:36.829
haki, so i don’t think Luffy would have
a real chance against either here.

00:12:36.829 --> 00:12:40.880
Then we have Luffy’s encounter with Blackbeard
in Impel Down.

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:43.269
Now Blackbeard is interesting.

00:12:43.269 --> 00:12:47.670
His darkness fruit is supposed to be the strongest
logia fruit alive.

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:51.970
However it doesn’t behave like a logia fruit
at all.

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:56.519
Blackbeard’s darkness has strong properties
of both gravity and absorption.

00:12:56.519 --> 00:12:59.640
He can pull things towards and into him.

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:06.720
Plus when he touches someone, Blackbeard is
able to nullify their devil fruit powers.

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:11.670
So we’ll have to wait and see if this fruit
truly is a logia fruit or whether it might

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:14.579
now be something else, similar to Luffy’s
fruit.

00:13:14.579 --> 00:13:20.769
Now, it would seem like Luffy having Kizaru’s
light powers would be perfect against darkness.

00:13:20.769 --> 00:13:25.690
However we know that even light can’t escape
form Blackbeards Darkness.

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:31.560
On the other hand, Teach is very vulnerable
to physical attacks, so especially the gravity

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:37.120
fruit would seem quite capable of taking him
down here, since it’s the only fruit where

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:42.519
blackbeard could not make contact with Luffy’s
body to nullify his powers.

00:13:42.519 --> 00:13:49.650
And if Luffy could stop teach here, that would
of course change a whole lot of things in

00:13:49.650 --> 00:13:56.030
the story.

00:13:56.030 --> 00:14:00.740
For the war at Marineford, really any of Luffy’s
new powers would be of much more use than

00:14:00.740 --> 00:14:03.000
his rubber powers were in the main time line.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:08.730
I think that especially Greenbull’s forest
fruit would absolutley shine here for the

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:09.730
first time ever.

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:15.350
After all, it is particularly useful when
attacking a large number of weaker enemies.

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:20.920
Luffy can take out whole squads of Marine
soldiers at once, absorbing their energy to

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:21.920
heal himself.

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:26.990
He could also use his roots to sneakily free
ace much faster, giving him a much better

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:29.470
chance to survive.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:35.649
And as a bonus, we do know that the forest
fruit is actually NOT weak to fire, something

00:14:35.649 --> 00:14:40.310
that Greenbull shows us when momonosuke tries
to set him on fire.

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:45.769
So Luffy would have a way better chance standing
up to akainu and causing a bit of trouble

00:14:45.769 --> 00:14:46.769
for him.

00:14:46.769 --> 00:14:52.220
However overall, Luffy would only become a
true monster with all these fruits, after

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:57.009
honing his skills with them for 2 years with
Rayleigh and combining them with Haki.

00:14:57.009 --> 00:15:02.449
So after the time skip, Luffy would once again
go through the first three enemies with ease.

00:15:02.449 --> 00:15:07.259
Fishman island, Ceasar on Punk Hazard and
even Doflamingo on Dressrosa, would stand

00:15:07.259 --> 00:15:12.410
not even the slightest chance against any
of these 5 Luffy’s.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:18.300
Luffy would also have no problems taking out
Katakuri and in case of the Magma fruit, you

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:22.449
could even argue that Luffy would be able
to put up a real fight against Big mom at

00:15:22.449 --> 00:15:23.889
that point.

00:15:23.889 --> 00:15:26.500
He definitely would not be captured by Big
Mom’s army.

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:30.920
And if he had the ice devil fruit, fleeing
Whole Cake island would also have been a piece

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:31.920
of cake.

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:32.920
lol.

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:35.720
So the real question is of course: What would
have happened against Kaido in Wano?

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:39.230
Let’s say Luffy also awakens his devil fruit
there once again.

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:43.790
Now admittedly, we don’t quite know yet
what an awakened Logia fruit is truly capable

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:48.790
of, but it’s very likely that many of the
crazy islands in the grand line were actually

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:52.110
shaped by awakened logia users in the past.

00:15:52.110 --> 00:15:57.589
So here’s my prediciton: I think that forest
luffy would once again lose.

00:15:57.589 --> 00:16:04.160
No way trees and plants would be able to seriously
damage Kaido with his wind blades and hardened

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:05.160
skin.

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:07.759
Luffy with the magma fruit could go either
way.

00:16:07.759 --> 00:16:13.930
Akainu’s fruit awakened sounds truly terrifying,
but then again, Kaido can fly.

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:17.579
Though he did end up in magma in the end to
be fair.

00:16:17.579 --> 00:16:21.769
Luffy with Kizaru’s fruit would have a pretty
decent chance to win I think.

00:16:21.769 --> 00:16:26.889
If Luffy advances his armament and conquorer’s
haki as much as in the main story line, he

00:16:26.889 --> 00:16:32.740
should be both fast and powerful enough with
his light powers to take Kaido out.

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:37.649
Similarly he could use both Gravity and Ice
to keep Kaido out of the air and slowly grind

00:16:37.649 --> 00:16:39.149
him down over time.

00:16:39.149 --> 00:16:44.860
The gravity fruit would be useful to bombard
Kaido with meteors, but that would also destroy

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:50.060
the entire island of onigashima, so it might
actually be a bit of a draw back here.

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:54.860
And I would actually argue that after wano,
Luffy’s actual devil fruit has turned out

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:58.870
to be even more powerful than any of these
5 anyways.

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:02.800
So maybe the much more interesting question
to ask here is not what would have happened

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:07.179
if Luffy did all the same stuff but with a
different devil fruit, but what would have

00:17:07.179 --> 00:17:12.199
happened to the one piece world, if Luffy
with his legendary Devil Fruit had been allowed

00:17:12.199 --> 00:17:15.600
to join Shanks and his crew as a kid?

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:19.579
Because that one is a much crazier timeline
than this.

00:17:19.579 --> 00:17:23.040
If you’re curious you can watch that one
right here.

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:23.639
Shanks for watching.

